# ── AquaVerse frontend (admin-panel) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# LOCALHOST (dev): leave VITE_API_URL UNSET. The Vite proxy forwards /api and
#   /socket.io to http://localhost:5000 (see vite.config.js). Just run `npm run dev`.
#
# NETLIFY (prod): set VITE_API_URL to your deployed backend's public URL (NO /api,
#   NO trailing slash). api.js appends /api and the socket connects to this host.
#   Set it in Netlify → Site settings → Environment variables, then redeploy.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://aquaverse-api.onrender.com
